 "な〜": "يَاه, اسمع (An exclamation to get attention.) / هَلَا (An informal greeting, similar to hi.)  [hey]\nused to get someone's attention or press one's point\nمثال: なあ、トム、悩みごとなんか忘れちゃって。\n→ Hey, Tom, forget about your worries. / يَعْنِي (Expression signifying a pause or hesitation.)  [you know]\nwhen seeking confirmation, for emphasis, etc.; used at sentence end\nمثال: 私は牛乳が飲みたいな。\n→ I want to drink milk. / عَجَبًا (An indication of excitement, surprise, astonishment, or pleasure.) / سُبْحَانَ الله (An expression of amazement, awe, or admiration.)  [wow]\nused to express admiration, emotionality, etc.; used at sentence end / [right? ; isn't it?]\nused as a request for confirmation or agreement; used at sentence end\nمثال: いい湯だなあ。\n→ Ah, this hot water's good!",
