 "なに": "يَا لَ (Emphasises that something is noteworthy or remarkable in quality or degree, in e) / مَا (That which; those that; the thing(s) that.) / مَاذَا, مَا (Anything that; all that; whatever.)  [what]\nمثال: 今のアナウンスは何だったのですか。\n→ What did the announcement just say? / [you-know-what ; that thing] / مَا اِسْمَهُ (A man whose identity is unknown or forgotten (especially when better-known to th)  [what's-his-name] / قَضِيب, ذَكَر (The male erectile reproductive organ used for sexual intercourse that in the hum)  [penis]\nesp. ナニ\nمثال: 「や、それほどでも。せいぜい、大きさ比べたり、わい談するくらいだし」「大きさって何の？」「ナニの」\n→ \"No, not so much. At most comparing sizes, telling dirty stories.\" \"Sizes of what?\" \"Of 'that'.\"",
 "なにおう": "مَشْهُور, شَهِير (Well known.) / مَشْهُور (In the public eye.)  [famous]",
 "なにか": "شَيْء (An uncertain or unspecified thing; one thing.)  [something]\nمثال: ここまでのところで何か落としていることはありませんか。\n→ Have I missed anything so far? / [somehow ; for some reason] / [(so) what (are you trying to say)? ; what (do you mean)?]\nمثال: 「もしや、あなたは小川さんではありませんか？」「そうですが、何か？」\n→ \"Might you happen to be Mr. Ogawa?\" \"Well, yes ... can I help you?\"",
 "なにかしら": "[somehow (or other) ; for some reason]\nمثال: あの映画を見ると何かしらインドへ行ったような気がします。\n→ Seeing that movie is something like taking a trip to India. / شَيْء (An uncertain or unspecified thing; one thing.)  [something (or other)]\nمثال: 子供はいつもなにかしらいたずらをしている。\n→ Children are always doing some mischief or other.",
 "なにかと": "بِطَرِيقَةٍ أَو بِأُخرَى (By any means possible.)  [one way or another]\nمثال: 妻がいないと何かと不自由だ。\n→ I am inconvenienced when my wife is away.",
 "なにかべつ": "آخَر, إِضَافِيّ (One more further, in addition to the quantity by then; a second or additional on) / آخَر, أُخْرَى (Not the same; different.)  [another]",
 "なにかもの": "أَيُّ شَيْءٍ (Any object, act, state, event, or fact whatsoever; a thing of any kind; somethin)  [anything]",
 "なにからなにまで": "مِنَ الأَلِف إِلَى اليَاء (Covering a complete range; comprehensively; from beginning to end.)  [from A to Z]\nمثال: そのパーティーが何から何まで楽しかったわけではない。\n→ The party was not altogether pleasant.",
 "なにがあっても": "مَهْمَا (Regardless of, in spite of, whatever.)  [no matter what]\nمثال: 何があっても海に行く！タオルに、海パン。虫除けスプレー！\n→ No matter what I'm going to the beach! Towel and trunks. Insect repellant!",
 "なにがあろうと": "مَهْمَا (Regardless of, in spite of, whatever.)  [no matter what]\nمثال: 何があろうとも私はあきらめない。\n→ Nothing can force me to give it up.",
 "なにがかなしくて": "لِمَاذَا ((interrogative) for what reason) / لِمَ ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاش ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاه ((interrogative) for what reason)  [why]\nemphatic, lamenting, sarcastic, often with なければならない, etc. / لِلْأَسَف, لِسُوءِ الْحَظِّ (Happening through bad luck, or because of some unfortunate event.)  [unfortunately]",
 "なにがし": "بَعْضٌ (A certain number (multiple but not all).) / بَعْض (An indefinite quantity.) / بَعْض (An indefinite amount; a part. Used mostly with abstract and nonliving objects.) / بَعْضٌ (A nonzero, unspecified proportion of (a bounded set of countable things): at lea)  [some]\nusu. in the form なにがしか / [certain person ; Mr So-and-so] / أَي, إِي (The name of the Latin script letter I/i.)  [I]",
 "なにがな": "شَيْء (An uncertain or unspecified thing; one thing.)  [something]",
 "なにがなにやら": "طُرَّةٌ أَم نَقْشٌ, طُرَّةٌ أَو نَقْشٌ (The practice of flipping a coin in the air, to choose between two alternatives b)  [heads or tails]\nusu. as ～わからない",
 "なにがなんだか": "طُرَّةٌ أَم نَقْشٌ, طُرَّةٌ أَو نَقْشٌ (The practice of flipping a coin in the air, to choose between two alternatives b)  [heads or tails]\nusu. as ～わからない\nمثال: この仕事は何が何だかさっぱり分からないわ。\n→ I can't make heads or tails of this assignment.",
 "なにがなんでも": "بِأَيِّ ثَمَنٍ (As an absolute imperative; sparing no effort or expense)  [at all costs]\nمثال: あなたが死ぬまでに何が何でも達成したいことはなんですか？\n→ What is it that you want to achieve, whatever it takes, before you die?",
 "なにげない": "غَيْر مُكْتَرِث, لَامُبَالٍ (Indifferent; unconcerned; behaving as if detached.)  [nonchalant]\nمثال: 何気なく言った言葉も誰かを傷つけることがある。\n→ A casual remark can hurt someone. / عَادِيّ, مَأْلُوف (Being part of the natural order of things; normal, customary, routine.)  [ordinary]",
 "なにげなく": "عَنْ غَفْلَةٍ (Without meaning to, in an unintentional manner, not intentionally.)  [unintentionally]",
 "なにげに": "عَنْ غَيْرِ قَصْدٍ, بِدُونِ قَصْدٍ (Unintentionally; because of an oversight.)  [inadvertently]\nمثال: なにげに話を聞いていたのね。\n→ You were just listening to the talk, without thinking. / بِصِدْقٍ (In a truthful manner)  [truthfully] / [after realizing ; without knowing]",
 "なにごと": "يَا لَ (Emphasises that something is noteworthy or remarkable in quality or degree, in e) / مَا (That which; those that; the thing(s) that.) / مَاذَا, مَا (Anything that; all that; whatever.)  [what]\nمثال: 何事が起こったのか誰もが知りたがっていた。\n→ Everybody was anxious to know what had happened. / كُلّ شَيْء (All the things under discussion.)  [everything]\nمثال: 私の友人は１年に３つも職を変えた。何事にも長続きはしないのだ。\n→ My friend has had three jobs in a year; he never sticks to anything for long. / [what (on earth)? ; what's the meaning of this ...?]\nused to rebuke someone\nمثال: 彼の信念は何事にも揺るがなかった。\n→ Nothing could sway his conviction.",
 "なにごとか": "شَيْء (An uncertain or unspecified thing; one thing.)  [something (or other)]\nمثال: 何事かが今にも起こりそうなけはいを感じていた。\n→ He felt that something was about to happen.",
 "なにごとも": "كُلّ شَيْء (All the things under discussion.)  [everything]\nمثال: トムは何事も楽しんでやるんだ。\n→ Tom enjoys himself at everything he does. / لَا شَيْء (Not any thing; no thing.)  [nothing]\nwith neg. verb\nمثال: この古い村では何事も起こらない。\n→ Nothing ever happens in this old village.",
 "なにさま": "أَحَد (One or some person of unspecified or indefinite identity.)  [a someone]\noften used sarcastically\nمثال: 自分を何様だと思っているのだ、人をそんな風に見て。\n→ Who do you think you are, to look at me like this? / مطلقا, على الإطلاق (In an absolute or unconditional manner; utterly, positively, wholly.)  [absolutely]",
 "なにしおう": "مَشْهُور, شَهِير (Well known.) / مَشْهُور (In the public eye.)  [famous]\nemphatic form of 名に負う",
 "なにしろ": "عَلَى أَيِّ حَالٍ (Whatever be the case.)  [in any case]\nمثال: 何しろ小さい店なので、彼は会計係から倉庫係まで多くの仕事を一手にこなさなければならない。\n→ Because the store is so small, he has to wear many different hats, from accountant to stock boy. / لِأَنَّ (By or for the cause that; on this account that; for the reason that.) / هكذا, بلا سبب (Used alone to refuse to provide a full answer to a question begun with \"why\", us)  [because]",
 "なにするものぞ": "تافِه (Ignorable; of little significance or value.)  [trivial]",
 "なにせ": "عَلَى أَيِّ حَالٍ (Whatever be the case.)  [in any case]\nمثال: 我々はボロ勝ちした。何せ相手の選手ときたら弱いのなんの。\n→ We won hands down, because the other players were weak.",
 "なにそつ": "أَرْضَى, أَعْجَبَ (To make happy or satisfy; to give pleasure to.) / مِن فَضْلِك (interjection to make a polite request) / رَجَاءً (interjection to make a polite request) / لَو سَمَحْت (interjection to make a polite request) / لُطْفًا (interjection to make a polite request) / أَرْجُوك (interjection to make a polite request)  [please]\nمثال: 浅学非才の私ではありますが、何とぞ皆様のお力を賜りたく、ここにお願い申し上げる次第です。\n→ I may not have much to offer in the way of learning or ability, but I want to do whatever I can for us all and humbly ask for your favor. / [by all means ; without fail]",
 "なにぞ": "شَيْء (An uncertain or unspecified thing; one thing.)  [something] / يَا لَ (Emphasises that something is noteworthy or remarkable in quality or degree, in e) / مَا (That which; those that; the thing(s) that.) / مَاذَا, مَا (Anything that; all that; whatever.)  [what] / لِمَاذَا ((interrogative) for what reason) / لِمَ ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاش ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاه ((interrogative) for what reason)  [why]",
 "なにとぞ": "أَرْضَى, أَعْجَبَ (To make happy or satisfy; to give pleasure to.) / مِن فَضْلِك (interjection to make a polite request) / رَجَاءً (interjection to make a polite request) / لَو سَمَحْت (interjection to make a polite request) / لُطْفًا (interjection to make a polite request) / أَرْجُوك (interjection to make a polite request)  [please]\nمثال: 浅学非才の私ではありますが、何とぞ皆様のお力を賜りたく、ここにお願い申し上げる次第です。\n→ I may not have much to offer in the way of learning or ability, but I want to do whatever I can for us all and humbly ask for your favor. / [by all means ; without fail]",
 "なになに": "يَا لَ (Emphasises that something is noteworthy or remarkable in quality or degree, in e) / مَا (That which; those that; the thing(s) that.) / مَاذَا, مَا (Anything that; all that; whatever.)  [what]\nused when asking about or referring to multiple unspecified things / فُلَان, فُلَانَة (A placeholder name for a person or thing, used when a name is not known; a gener)  [so-and-so]\nused when listing things that are unknown or do not need to be specified / اِنْتَظَرَ (To delay movement or action until some event or time; to remain neglected or in )  [wait]\nused when asking for confirmation upon hearing something surprising / [well, well ; let's see]\nused when about to read a letter or document",
 "なににでも": "كُلّ شَيْء (All the things under discussion.)  [everything]\nمثال: 要するに彼は何にでも飽きるのだ。\n→ In a word, he tires of everything.",
 "なににも": "كُلّ شَيْء (All the things under discussion.)  [everything]\n何(なに) + にも",
 "なにはさておき": "أَوَّلًا, قَبْلَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Firstly; before anything else.)  [first of all]",
 "なにはともあれ": "عَلَى أَيِّ حَالٍ (Whatever be the case.)  [in any case]\nمثال: 何はともあれ、大事にいたらなかったのは、不幸中の幸いであった。\n→ At any rate, that it had ended without serious incident was a small mercy.",
 "なにひとつ": "وَاحِد, وَاحِدَة (The number represented by the Arabic numeral 1; the numerical value equal to tha) / اَلْمَرْء (Any person (applying to people in general).)  [(not) one]\nusu. in neg. phrases\nمثال: 彼は子供たちに何一つだめだと言わない。\n→ He denies nothing to his children.",
 "なにびと": "مَنْ (Any person or persons that.)  [whoever]\nمثال: 何びとも奴隷の状態に留め置かれてはならない。\n→ No one shall be held in slavery.",
 "なにびとも": "مَن, مين (What person or people; which person or people; asks for the identity of someone;)  [(no matter) who]\nمثال: 何人も空の胃の腑では愛国者たり得ない。\n→ No man can be a patriot on an empty stomach. / [nobody]\nwith neg. verb",
 "なにぶん": "بَعْضٌ (A certain number (multiple but not all).) / بَعْض (An indefinite quantity.) / بَعْض (An indefinite amount; a part. Used mostly with abstract and nonliving objects.) / بَعْضٌ (A nonzero, unspecified proportion of (a bounded set of countable things): at lea)  [some] / أَرْضَى, أَعْجَبَ (To make happy or satisfy; to give pleasure to.) / مِن فَضْلِك (interjection to make a polite request) / رَجَاءً (interjection to make a polite request) / لَو سَمَحْت (interjection to make a polite request) / لُطْفًا (interjection to make a polite request) / أَرْجُوك (interjection to make a polite request)  [please] / عَلَى كُلِّ حَال, على كل حال (Regardless; anyhow.) / عَلَى أَيُّ حَالٍ, على كل حال (Used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement. See)  [anyway]\nمثال: なにぶんこんな辺ぴな村に住んでいるので、めったに客は来ない。\n→ Living as I do in a remote village, I seldom have visitors.",
 "なにぶんにも": "عَلَى كُلِّ حَال, على كل حال (Regardless; anyhow.) / عَلَى أَيُّ حَالٍ, على كل حال (Used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement. See)  [anyway]",
 "なにほど": "كَمْ (What amount or quantity of (something stated or implied).)  [how much]",
 "なにぼう": "[certain person ; Mr So-and-so]",
 "なにも": "أَيُّ شَيْءٍ (Any object, act, state, event, or fact whatsoever; a thing of any kind; somethin)  [(not) anything]\nwith neg. verb\nمثال: 過ちのない者は何も作り出せない。\n→ He who makes no mistakes makes nothing. / [and everything else ; and all]\nas ...も何も\nمثال: 車も何もなく、生活保護で生きてます。\n→ I'm living on welfare, without a car or anything. / أبداً (Indicating degree, quantity or frequency greater than zero: to the slightest deg)  [(not) at all]\nas ...なくてもいい, ...ことはない, etc.",
 "なにもの": "مَن, مين (What person or people; which person or people; asks for the identity of someone;)  [who]\nمثال: そこで、今の人達が何者なのか説明しておきたいと思います。\n→ So I want to explain who these people are.",
 "なにものか": "أَحَد (One or some person of unspecified or indefinite identity.)  [someone]\nمثال: 何者かが彼女を浴槽で溺死させた。\n→ Somebody had drowned her in the bathtub.",
 "なにやつ": "مَن, مين (What person or people; which person or people; asks for the identity of someone;)  [who]",
 "なにやら": "شَيْء (An uncertain or unspecified thing; one thing.)  [something]\nمثال: 私はなにやら彼に話さなければならないことがある。\n→ I have something or other to tell him. / [for some reason]\nمثال: なにやら唸りながら、ほとばしるパッションをキャンバスにぶつけている！\n→ Groaning strangely she is hurling her overflowing passion onto the canvas!",
 "なにゆえ": "لِمَاذَا ((interrogative) for what reason) / لِمَ ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاش ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاه ((interrogative) for what reason)  [why]",
 "なにゆえに": "لِمَاذَا ((interrogative) for what reason) / لِمَ ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاش ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاه ((interrogative) for what reason)  [why]",
 "なにより": "[above anything else ; above all]\nمثال: 何より大事なことは、自分の頭で考えることだ。\n→ The most important thing is thinking for oneself. / أَفْضَل (superlative form of good: most good.)  [best]\nمثال: 私は自分が健康で何よりだと思っている。\n→ I count myself lucky in having good health.",
 "なによりもまず": "بَادِئَ ذِي بَدْءٍ (Primarily; most importantly.)  [first and foremost]\nمثال: 何よりもまず、老人に親切にするように努めなさい。\n→ Above all, try to be kind to the old.",
 "なにら": "أبداً (Indicating degree, quantity or frequency greater than zero: to the slightest deg)  [(not) at all]\nwith neg. verb\nمثال: 彼はその不正事件に何ら関わりがなかった。\n→ He had no part in the scandal. / [what kind of]",
 "なにを": "[what?] / لِمَاذَا ((interrogative) for what reason) / لِمَ ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاش ((interrogative) for what reason) / علاه ((interrogative) for what reason)  [why]",
 "なの": "بَلَى, مبلا (Used to indicate disagreement or dissent in reply to a negative statement.) / نَعَم, نَعَمَانِ (An affirmative expression; an answer that shows agreement or acceptance.)  [yes]\nat sentence-end with falling intonation; used to make an assertion\nمثال: 母は私がアルバイトをすることに反対なの。\n→ My mother objected to my working part time. / [is that so? ; is it?]\nat sentence-end with rising intonation",
 "なのしれた": "مَشْهُور, شَهِير (Well known.) / مَشْهُور (In the public eye.)  [famous]",
 "なので": "لِأَنَّ (By or for the cause that; on this account that; for the reason that.) / هكذا, بلا سبب (Used alone to refuse to provide a full answer to a question begun with \"why\", us)  [because]\nafter nouns or na-adjectives\nمثال: 慌て者なので彼はきっと早とちりをするだろう。\n→ Being a hasty person, he is likely to jump to conclusions. / إِذَنْ, لِذٰلِكَ (Consequently, by or in consequence of that or this cause; referring to something)  [therefore]\nat sentence beginning",
 "なのとおった": "مَشْهُور, شَهِير (Well known.) / مَشْهُور (In the public eye.)  [famous]",
 "なのめ": "مُنْحَدَر (An area of ground that tends evenly upward or downward.) / مَيْل (The degree to which a surface tends upward or downward.)  [sloping]\nمثال: えらくご機嫌ななめね、けんか腰にならないで。\n→ Wow, you're really in a bad mood. Don't get scrappy. / شَوَّهَ (To bring something out of shape, to misshape.)  [distorted (feeling)]",
 "なのる": "[to give one's name (as) ; to introduce oneself (as)]\nمثال: 支配人はドアを開いて身分を名乗った。\n→ The manager opened the door and identified himself. / [to claim to be ; to call oneself] / [to reveal oneself (as) ; to admit to being] / أَخَذَ (To get into one's hands, possession, or control, with or without force.) / أَخَذَ بِـ (To receive or accept (something, especially something which was given).) / اِتَّخَذَ (To receive or accept (something, especially something which was given).) / أَخَذَ (To receive or accept (something, especially something which was given).) / أَخَذَ (To grasp or grip.) / اِسْتَغْرَقَ (To fill or require: to last or expend (an amount of time).)  [to take (a name)]",
 "なは": "نَاهَا (The capital city of Okinawa, Japan.)  [Naha (city in Okinawa)]",
 "なはる": "فَعَلَ, عَمِلَ (To perform; to execute.) / دُو, دُو (A syllable used in solfège to represent the first and eighth tonic of a major sc)  [to do]",
 "なびかす": "أَغْرَى, أَغْوَى (To entice or induce (someone) to engage in a sexual relationship.)  [to seduce]",
 "なびかせる": "ذُبَابَة, دبان (Especially, any of the insects of the family Muscidae, such as the common housef) / طَارَ (to travel through air) / طار (to travel through air)  [to fly (a flag)] / [to win (someone) over ; to bring over to one's side]",
 "なびく": "ثَنَى (to cause to shape into a curve)  [to bend]\nمثال: カーテンが風になびいた。\n→ The curtains blew in the wind. / أَطَاعَ (To do as ordered by (a person, institution etc), to act according to the bidding)  [to obey]",
 "なふだ": "مُلْصَق, بِطَاقَة (A small ticket or sign giving information about something to which it is attache)  [label]\nمثال: 自分の荷に名札を付けたけれども、すぐに取れてしまった。\n→ I attached my name-tag to my baggage, but it soon came off.",
 "なぶりもの": "عَقْب سِيجَارَة (An end of something, often distinguished in some way from the other end.)  [butt (of jokes)]",
 "なぶり者": "عَقْب سِيجَارَة (An end of something, often distinguished in some way from the other end.)  [butt (of jokes)]",
 "なぶる": "سَخِرَ, اِسْتَهْزَأَ (To tease, ridicule or make jokes about, generally in a pejorative manner.)  [to make fun of] / تَهَكَّمَ, سَخِرَ (To criticize or disapprove of someone or something through scornful jocularity; )  [to ridicule] / [to play with (e.g. a toy) ; to fiddle with]",
 "なへに": "رَافَقَ (To go with or attend as a companion or associate; to keep company with; to go al) / صَاحَبَ, رَافَقَ (To perform an accompanying part or parts in a composition.) / رَافَقَ (To associate in a company; to keep company.)  [accompanying]",
 "なへん": "أَيْن, فين (In, at or to what place.) / حَيْثُ (The place in, at or to which.) / أَيْن (The place in which something happens.)  [where]",
 "なべ": "مِقْلَاة (flat vessel used for cooking — see also frying pan) / ينتقد بشدَة (To disparage; to belittle; to put down; to harshly criticize, especially a work )  [pan]\nمثال: ここに手のないナベがある。\n→ Here is a pan without handles. / يَخْنَة (A dish cooked by stewing.)  [stew]",
 "なべて": "عُمُومًا (Popularly or widely.) / بِوَجْهٍ عَامّ (Without reference to specific details.)  [generally]",
 "なべに": "رَافَقَ (To go with or attend as a companion or associate; to keep company with; to go al) / صَاحَبَ, رَافَقَ (To perform an accompanying part or parts in a composition.) / رَافَقَ (To associate in a company; to keep company.)  [accompanying]",
 "なべもの": "يَخْنَة (A dish cooked by stewing.)  [stew]\nمثال: この鍋物はえぐいよ。\n→ This stew tastes acrid.",
 "なべ物": "يَخْنَة (A dish cooked by stewing.)  [stew]\nمثال: この鍋物はえぐいよ。\n→ This stew tastes acrid.",
 "なま": "خَام (Unrefined, crude, or insensitive, especially with reference to sexual matters. ()  [raw]\nمثال: アメリカ人にはよくあることだが彼はなまの魚を好かない。\n→ As is often the case with Americans, he does not care for raw fish. / طَبِيعِيّ (of or relating to nature)  [natural] / خَام (Unrefined, crude, or insensitive, especially with reference to sexual matters. ()  [raw]\nمثال: ゴムをすると確かに性感が落ちるので、出来れば生でしたいです。\n→ The sensitivity certainly drops if I use a condom, so if possible I'd like to do it bareback. / حَيِيَ, عَاشَ (To be alive; to have life.) / يَنْجُو (To survive; to persevere; to continue.) / حَيّ (Having life; that is alive.) / مُباشِر (Being broadcast (“on the air”), as it happens.)  [live (i.e. not recorded)]\nمثال: ある批評家が、バレーを描いた私の絵を見たら、生のバレー公演を見に行く必要がないと言ったことがあります。\n→ A critic once said that if you saw my ballet paintings, you didn't have to go to a live performance.",
