 "なやましげ": "قَلِق, قَلِقَة (Nervous and worried.) / قَلِق, قَلِقَة (Having a feeling of anxiety or disquietude; extremely concerned, especially abou) / قَلِق, قَلِقَة (Accompanied with, or causing, anxiety; worrying.)  [anxious (appearance)]\nمثال: 彼女の悩ましげな姿を見て、彼はすっかり夢中になってしまいました。\n→ After seeing her provocative body, he became obsessed with her. / شَوْق (A wistful or melancholy longing.)  [yearning (look, etc.)]",
 "なやます": "عَذَاب (Any extreme pain, anguish or misery, either physical or mental.) / عَذَّبَ (To cause severe suffering to (stronger than to vex but weaker than to torture.))  [to torment]\nمثال: そんなささいなことで私を悩まさないでくれ。\n→ Don't bother me with such trifles.",
