 "なら": "إِنْ (supposing that) / لَوْ (supposing that) / إِذَا (supposing that)  [if]\nhypothetical form of the copula だ, from なり and sometimes classed as a particle\nمثال: 感情によって理性が曇らされているままにしておくならば、我々は、常に見当違いのことをしてしまうだろう。\n→ If we let our reasoning power be overshadowed by our emotions, we would be barking up the wrong tree all the time. / أَمَّا ... فَـ (Regarding; about; concerning.)  [as for]\nمثال: 医者なら６桁の収入は珍しくない。\n→ A six-figure income is not uncommon for physicians. / [if that's the case ; if so]",
 "ならいごと": "تَنْفِيذ (The act of accomplishing; completion; fulfilment.)  [accomplishment]",
 "ならう": "تَعَلَّمَ (To acquire, or attempt to acquire knowledge or an ability to do something.) / تَعَلَّمَ (To attend a course or other educational activity.) / اِعْتَبَرَ, اِتَّعَظَ (To gain knowledge from a bad experience so as to improve.)  [to learn (from a teacher)]\nمثال: 車の運転を習っています。\n→ I've been learning to drive.",
