 "ならくのそこ": "[depths of Hell] / هَاوِيَة (Hell; the bottomless pit; primeval chaos; a confined subterranean ocean.) / هَاوِيَة, هُوَّة (A bottomless or unfathomed depth, gulf, or chasm; hence, any deep, immeasurable;)  [abyss]",
 "ならし": "مُتَوَسِّط, مُعَدَّل (Any measure of central tendency, especially any mean, the median, or the mode.) / مُتَوَسِّط, مُعَدَّل (Constituting or relating to the average.)  [average]\nمثال: 彼らはブルドーザーで道ならしをしている。\n→ They are now leveling the road with a bulldozer.",
