 "なんのこと": "يَا لَ (Emphasises that something is noteworthy or remarkable in quality or degree, in e) / مَا (That which; those that; the thing(s) that.) / مَاذَا, مَا (Anything that; all that; whatever.)  [what] / [something out of the ordinary ; something unusual] / [what the heck ; holy cow!]",
 "なんのことはない": "تافِه (Ignorable; of little significance or value.)  [trivial]",
 "なんのへんてつもない": "بَسِيط (Simple, unaltered.) / سَهْل (An expanse of land with relatively low relief and few trees, especially a grassy)  [plain]",
