 "なんぴとも": "مَن, مين (What person or people; which person or people; asks for the identity of someone;)  [(no matter) who]\nمثال: 何人も空の胃の腑では愛国者たり得ない。\n→ No man can be a patriot on an empty stomach. / [nobody]\nwith neg. verb",
 "なんぴん": "مُتَوَسِّط, مُعَدَّل (Any measure of central tendency, especially any mean, the median, or the mode.) / مُتَوَسِّط, مُعَدَّل (Constituting or relating to the average.)  [averaging]",
