 "なんぼう": "كَمْ (What amount or quantity of (something stated or implied).)  [how much] / بِأَيَّةِ طَرِيقَة, عَلَى كُلِّ حَال (In any way that one likes or chooses; in a haphazard or spontaneous way.)  [however (much)]\nas なんぼう...〜とも, etc.",
