 "なんぽう": "جَنُوب (compass point) / جنوب (compass point) / جَنوب (compass point)  [the south]\nمثال: 私の故郷の町はニューヨークの南方１０マイルのところにある。\n→ My home town lies 10 miles south of New York. / [countries in the south (esp. Southeast Asia and the pre-WWII South Pacific Mandate)]",
