 "なんも": "أَيُّ شَيْءٍ (Any object, act, state, event, or fact whatsoever; a thing of any kind; somethin)  [(not) anything]\nwith neg. verb\nمثال: 過ちのない者は何も作り出せない。\n→ He who makes no mistakes makes nothing. / [and everything else ; and all]\nas ...も何も\nمثال: 車も何もなく、生活保護で生きてます。\n→ I'm living on welfare, without a car or anything. / أبداً (Indicating degree, quantity or frequency greater than zero: to the slightest deg)  [(not) at all]\nas ...なくてもいい, ...ことはない, etc.",
