 "にかいだてバス": "حافلة بطابقين, حافلة ذات طابقين (A bus that has two levels (decks) of seating.)  [double-decker bus]",
 "にかぎって": "وَحِيد (1. alone in a category) / فَقَط (Without others or anything further; exclusively.) / فَقَط (No more than; just.) / فَقَط (Introduces a clause with negative polarity, often one which upsets the listener')  [only]\nXに限って expresses an exclusive focus on X, with a negative result, impact, etc.\nمثال: 夜寝れない時に限って、時計のカチカチいう音が気になるものだ。\n→ It's only when I can't sleep at night that the ticking of the clock becomes loud enough to bother me.",
