 "にちにち": "يَوْمِيّ (That occurs or attends every day, or at least every working day.) / يَوْمِيًّا, كُلَّ يَوْمٍ (quotidianly, every day)  [daily]\nمثال: 彼はどうやって日々の生計をたてていたのですか。\n→ How did he earn his daily bread? / أَيَّام (Life.)  [days (e.g. of one's youth)]\nمثال: 私たちが一緒に暮らした楽しい日々を覚えている。\n→ I remember the happy days we spent together. / يَوْمًا بَعْدَ يَوْم (For an indefinite number of days.)  [day after day]\nمثال: 野菜の値段は日々変わる。\n→ The price of vegetables varies from day to day.",
