 "につき": "بِسَبَب, بِحُكْم (On account of; due to, for the purpose of.)  [because of] / حَوْلَ (In a circle around; all round; on every side of; on the outside of; around.) / عَلَى وَشَكِ (Indicates that something will happen very soon; indicates a plan or intention to) / عَن (Concerning; with regard to; on account of; on the subject of.) / عَن (Concerned or occupied with; engaged in; intent on.) / حَوَالِي (Nearly; approximately; with close correspondence in quality, manner, degree, qua)  [about] / لِكُلّ (For each.) / فِي كُلّ (To each, in each (used in expressing ratios of units).) / بِنَاءً عَلَى, لِأَجْل (In accordance with, as per.)  [per]\nمثال: その品物を１ダースにつき３ドルで買う。\n→ I buy the goods at $3 a dozen.",
 "につきまして": "حَوْلَ (In a circle around; all round; on every side of; on the outside of; around.) / عَلَى وَشَكِ (Indicates that something will happen very soon; indicates a plan or intention to) / عَن (Concerning; with regard to; on account of; on the subject of.) / عَن (Concerned or occupied with; engaged in; intent on.) / حَوَالِي (Nearly; approximately; with close correspondence in quality, manner, degree, qua)  [about]\noft. as ～は\nمثال: ７月２２日付けのお手紙につきまして私共の最新の目録を同封します。\n→ With regard to your letter of July 22nd, I enclose our most recent catalogue.",
 "につけ": "كُلَّمَا (At each occasion that.)  [every time]\nfollowing a verb of cognition, e.g. 見る, 思う\nمثال: パリで撮った妻の写真を見るにつけ、あの時の楽しかった旅行を思い出す。\n→ When I see the photo of my wife I took in Paris, I remember what a great time we had on that trip. / إِذَا مَا, إِذَا (Introduces a simple indirect question (without a correlative).)  [whether]\nas ...につけ...につけ",
 "につけて": "كُلَّمَا (At each occasion that.)  [every time]\nfollowing a verb of cognition, e.g. 見る, 思う / إِذَا مَا, إِذَا (Introduces a simple indirect question (without a correlative).)  [whether]\nas ...につけて...につけて",
 "につめる": "رَكَّزَ (To bring to, or direct toward, a common center; to unite more closely; to gather) / رَكَّزَ, تَرَكَّزَ (To focus one's thought or attention (on).) / مركز (A substance that is in a condensed form.)  [to concentrate (soup, milk, stock, etc.)]\nمثال: スープがとろっとするまで煮つめてください。\n→ Boil the soup down until it becomes thick. / [to reach a conclusion ; to conclude a discussion]",
