 "にづめ": "حُزْمَة, عُبُوَّة (A bundle made up and prepared to be carried; especially, a bundle to be carried ) / وَضَّبَ (to put things together for storage or transporting) / حَزَمَ (to put things together for storage or transporting)  [packing]",
