 "に付き": "بِسَبَب, بِحُكْم (On account of; due to, for the purpose of.)  [because of] / حَوْلَ (In a circle around; all round; on every side of; on the outside of; around.) / عَلَى وَشَكِ (Indicates that something will happen very soon; indicates a plan or intention to) / عَن (Concerning; with regard to; on account of; on the subject of.) / عَن (Concerned or occupied with; engaged in; intent on.) / حَوَالِي (Nearly; approximately; with close correspondence in quality, manner, degree, qua)  [about] / لِكُلّ (For each.) / فِي كُلّ (To each, in each (used in expressing ratios of units).) / بِنَاءً عَلَى, لِأَجْل (In accordance with, as per.)  [per]\nمثال: その品物を１ダースにつき３ドルで買う。\n→ I buy the goods at $3 a dozen.",
