 "はむかう": "شَغَّلَ (To power up, to put into operation, to start, to activate (an appliance, light, ) / اِنْقَلَبَ عَلَى (To rebel against; to suddenly attack.)  [to turn on]\nمثال: ウサギでさえ、いじめられて片隅に追いつめられると、刃向かってくるだろう。\n→ Even a rabbit, if badgered into a corner, will fight back.",
