 "はもの": "سِكِّين, مُدْيَة (A utensil or a tool designed for cutting, consisting of a flat piece of hard mat) / خَنْجَر, خنجر (A weapon designed with the aforementioned specifications intended for slashing o) / نَصْل, شَفْرَة (Any blade-like part in a tool or a machine designed for cutting, such as that of)  [knife]\nمثال: そのように刃物を振り回すことは危険だ。\n→ It is dangerous to wield an edged tool in such a way.",
