 "はや": "قَد, مِنْ قَبْلُ (Prior to some specified time, either past, present, or future; by this time; pre) / لقد (So soon.)  [already] / سَرِيع (Moving with speed, rapidity or swiftness, or capable of doing so; rapid; fast.) / سَرِيعٌ (Occurring in a short time; happening or done rapidly.) / حَيٌّ (Alive, living.) / جَارٍ (Pregnant, especially at the stage where the foetus's movements can be felt; figu) / سَرِيعًا, بِسُرْعَةٍ (Quickly, in a quick manner.)  [quick]\nمثال: 早熟れの早腐り。\n→ Soon ripe, soon rotten.",
 "はやい": "عميق (Deep or sound (of sleep); fast asleep (of people).) / بِسُرْعَة, عَاجِلًا (Quickly, with great speed; within a short time .) / صَامَ (To cause (a person or animal) to abstain, especially from eating.)  [fast]\nesp. 速い\nمثال: あれは世界で最も速い電車です。\n→ That is the fastest train in the world. / بَاكِر (At a time in advance of the usual or expected event.) / مُبَكِّرًا, بَاكِرًا (At a time before expected; sooner than usual.)  [early]\nمثال: 今年は春の訪れが早かった。\n→ Spring has come early this year. / [premature ; too soon]\nمثال: それを今論議するのはまだ早い。\n→ It is premature to discuss it now. / سَهْل (Requiring little skill or effort.)  [easy]\nesp. 早い",
