 "はやがねをうつ": "مِطْرَقَة, شَاكُوش (A tool with a heavy head and a handle used for pounding.) / مِطْرَقَة (The malleus, a small bone of the middle ear.)  [to hammer]\nمثال: 彼女の心臓は恐怖で早鐘を打った。\n→ Her heart beat quickly out of fear.",
