 "はやめる": "يقرب (To move forward in space or time.)  [to advance]\nusu. 早める\nمثال: その薬が成長の過程を早めた。\n→ The medicine hastened the process of growth. / أَحْيَا (Senses relating to life or states of activity.) / سَرَّعَ (Senses relating to speed.)  [to quicken (e.g. one's step)]\nusu. 速める\nمثال: 我々はふだんより足を速めて歩いた。\n→ We walked more quickly than usual.",
